Recruiter > Web: Enter terms and upload PDF
Web > API: Save draft offer version
API > S3: Store private approved scan target
API > Supabase: Save terms document and approval steps
Recruiter > Web: Submit for approval
Web > API: Freeze active version
API > Supabase: Activate first ordered step and notification
Approver > Web: Approve current step
Web > API: Approve with version
API > Supabase: Audit decision and activate next step
Approver > Web: Final approver approves
Web > API: Final approval
API > Supabase: Mark version approved
Recruiter > Web: Deliver offer
Web > API: Deliver with idempotency key
API > Worker: Queue message
Worker > S3: Read approved PDF
Worker > SES: Send candidate email and attachment
SES > Candidate: Deliver offer
SES > Worker: Delivery or bounce event
Worker > Supabase: Save message status and activity
